  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "AgroCraft",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 13
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Gemelo digital de una granja en Minecraft\nLos bloques del mundo son **sensores y actuadores IoT**. El clima real de Bucaramanga (Open-Meteo) gobierna lluvia, hora, secado del suelo y temperatura del gemelo.\n\n**Protocolos:** MQTT 3.1.1 (TLS 8883 · WSS 443) · HTTPS REST\n\n**Clases:** Real · Digital Twin · API · DataSet\n\n**Marcas en las gráficas:** naranja = comando de retroceso aceptado; morado = evento del dispositivo (riego, bomba, cosecha, intruso, alarma).\n\nDetalle por dispositivo con promedio, máximo y mínimo: menú *AgroCraft* → *Por dispositivo*.\n\n[Panel de control](/iot/) · [Mapa del mundo](/map/?world=minecraft_overworld&zoom=5&x=12&z=0)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Estado de la flota",
      "description": "Un dispositivo está fuera de línea si no envía datos en 3 intervalos.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "influxdb",
        "uid": "influx-agro"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 16,
        "h": 13
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "influxdb",
            "uid": "influx-agro"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "query": "import \"array\"\nimport \"join\"\ndevices = array.from(rows: [\n  {clase: \"twin\", device: \"mc-parcela-a\", intervalo: 30},\n  {clase: \"twin\", device: \"mc-parcela-b\", intervalo: 30},\n  {clase: \"twin\", device: \"mc-tanque\", intervalo: 30},\n  {clase: \"twin\", device: \"mc-invernadero\", intervalo: 30},\n  {clase: \"twin\", device: \"mc-silo\", intervalo: 60},\n  {clase: \"twin\", device: \"mc-seguridad\", intervalo: 30},\n  {clase: \"twin\", device: \"mc-estacion\", intervalo: 60},\n  {clase: \"twin\", device: \"mc-server\", intervalo: 30},\n  {clase: \"twin\", device: \"mc-corral\", intervalo: 30},\n  {clase: \"api\", device: \"api-clima\", intervalo: 300},\n  {clase: \"api\", device: \"api-aire\", intervalo: 600},\n  {clase: \"api\", device: \"api-suelo\", intervalo: 600},\n  {clase: \"api\", device: \"api-pronostico\", intervalo: 900},\n  {clase: \"dataset\", device: \"ds-invernadero\", intervalo: 300},\n  {clase: \"dataset\", device: \"ds-energia\", intervalo: 60},\n  {clase: \"real\", device: \"gw-pc-01\", intervalo: 30},\n  {clase: \"real\", device: \"phone-01\", intervalo: 30},\n  {clase: \"real\", device: \"esp32-01\", intervalo: 30}\n])\nlast = from(bucket: \"telemetry\")\n  |> range(start: -7d)\n  |> filter(fn: (r) => r._measurement == \"telemetry\" and r._field == \"seq\")\n  |> group(columns: [\"device\"])\n  |> last()\n  |> group()\n  |> map(fn: (r) => ({device: r.device, ultima: r._time, muestras: r._value,\n                      hace_s: (uint(v: now()) - uint(v: r._time)) / uint(v: 1000000000)}))\njoin.left(\n  left: devices,\n  right: last,\n  on: (l, r) => l.device == r.device,\n  as: (l, r) => ({clase: l.clase, dispositivo: l.device, ultima: r.ultima, hace_s: r.hace_s,\n                  muestras: r.muestras,\n                  estado: if not exists r.hace_s then \"sin datos\"\n                          else if int(v: r.hace_s) > 3 * l.intervalo then \"fuera de línea\"\n                          else \"en línea\"}),\n)\n  |> keep(columns: [\"clase\", \"dispositivo\", \"estado\", \"ultima\", \"hace_s\", \"muestras\"])"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto"
            },
            "inspect": true
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "estado"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "color-background",
                  "mode": "basic"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "en línea": {
                        "color": "#73BF69",
                        "index": 0
                      },
                      "fuera de línea": {
                        "color": "#F2495C",
                        "index": 1
                      },
                      "sin datos": {
                        "color": "#3a3f47",
                        "index": 2
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "hace_s"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "s"
              },
              {
                "id": "displayName",
                "value": "hace"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "ultima"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "dateTimeAsLocal"
              },
              {
                "id": "displayName",
                "value": "última muestra"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "muestras"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "decimals",
                "value": 0
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": {
          "show": false
        }
      },
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "indexByName": {
              "clase": 0,
              "dispositivo": 1,
              "estado": 2,
              "hace_s": 3,
              "ultima": 4,
              "muestras": 5
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
